notes:        Original work for this repository, in Atelier's colours, derived from the Atelier Reel app icon (assets/app-icon/filmcraft.svg, referenced via <image>, not copied). Written by packaging/macos/dmg/atelier-background.py; text is outlined Archivo / Geist Mono glyph paths (OFL-1.1). Used for the Finder window of the macOS DMG; packaging/macos/dmg/generate.py renders it to background.tiff. See packaging/macos/dmg/README.md.
